@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
# 改为创建停用商品后返回的 data.id。
@inactiveProductId = 2

### 准备启用商品，记录返回的 data.id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"name": "可见性 Demo 启用商品", "price": 19.90, "active": true}}

### 准备停用商品，记录返回的 data.id
# 本地 local-developer 保留主数据写权限，便于准备 Demo 数据。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"name": "可见性 Demo 停用商品", "price": 9.90, "active": false}}

### 不传 active：consumer 只返回启用商品，management 返回全部状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/page
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"page": 1, "limit": 10, "sorts": [{"field": "id", "direction": "DESC"}]}}

### 反向筛选：consumer 返回空页，management 返回停用商品
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/page
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"filter": {"active": false}}}

### 停用商品详情：consumer 返回 404，management 返回详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/detail
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"filter": {"id": {{inactiveProductId}}}}}

### 尝试伪造管理入口：返回 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/page
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"crudAccessEntry": "management"}}
